    "body": "<h1>Rate limits &amp; errors {{ds:component/chip|label=v2|variant=primary}}</h1>

{{ds:component/stat|value=1,000|label=requests / minute|description=Default rate limit for standard-tier API keys, per workspace.}}

<h2 id="headers">Rate limit headers</h2>
<p>Every response includes <code>X-RateLimit-Limit</code>, <code>X-RateLimit-Remaining</code>, and <code>X-RateLimit-Reset</code>. A request over the limit returns <code>429 Too Many Requests</code> with a <code>Retry-After</code> header.</p>

<h2 id="pagination">Pagination</h2>
<p>List endpoints (<a href="{{cms:item/5ac66235-69dc-4092-b430-9d68837e0c76}}#list">Pipelines</a>, Connectors, <a href="{{cms:item/6277e4fb-3e99-45b0-a7f6-aefe69c5778f}}">Events</a>) use cursor-based pagination — a departure from v1's offset-based pagination.</p>

{{ds:component/code-block|filename=list-response.json|language=json|code=&#123;
